From fe2139689a19f9eb31c52cfee4e0461d5a161cf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: salvia420-bit <salvia420@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:20:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/29] Vehicles (holtburger fork): Tier 5 round-2 remediation
 fixes and regression tests

Fixes 4 remaining bugs from Tier 5 Challenger 3 audit:
- GroundRadarDeployable.ScanContacts Loop 3 excludes Player, Vendor, Pet, Cow, GamePiece, non-attackable, Tolerance.NoAttack, indoor, dead, destroyed, and teleporting creatures so owned turrets target only outdoor hostile monsters.
- RadarStation.IsActive, AirDefenseManager.Tick, AirDefenseSensor, and VehicleManager.ToggleDeployableStow clear stale AirTracks and skip inactive sensors on stow/deactivation.
- Vehicle.ToGlobal, VehicleManager.IsDericostCell (plus EnsureLoaded/Relocate), and LandblockId.Continent/GetHashCode guard Dericost bit 15 against indoor EnvCells (>= 0x100) and 0xFFFF BlockCellID sentinels.
- MicroGrid.Tick returns early on deltaSeconds <= 0, NaN, or Infinity.
- Added regression tests covering all 4 ACE fixes and updated ChallengerM2ContinentStressTests for high-bit Dereth indoor EnvCells (0x8100..0x8FFF).

Verified with dotnet test ACE.Server.Tests (Vehicles|Landblock): 354/354 passed.
